s & Features:\n* **Night Vision Mode:** Enhances visibility in dim environments using a custom phosphor-green 3D Color LUT.\n* **Live Color Grading Controls:** Fine-tune **Brightness**, **Contrast**, and **Saturation** in real time to brighten dark rooms, boost vibrancy, or create a clean monochrome look.\n* **Hardware Edge Detection & Custom Outline Colors:** Highlight physical objects, walls, and furniture in your room with real-time glowing edge outlines and customize the outline color (Neon Green, Cyan, Red, Gold, White.\n* **Clean Floating Studio HUD:** Adjust sliders effortlessly in mixed reality, reset to normal passthrough with a single click, or hide the control panel to enjoy an unobstructed view of your space.", "short_description": "Transform your real-world view in real time with Passthrough Color Studio. Switch between Night Vision and live Custom Color Grading\u2014fine-tuning brightness, contrast, saturation, and glowing edge outlines with customizable colors in mixed reality."}]}, "developer_name": "Passthrough Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/justme228/passthrough-color-studio/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Passthrough Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/justme228/passthrough-color-studio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [],